<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Asia Securities shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Asia Securities shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares in investment group Asia Securities International Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The company's shares rose HK$0.65 or 14.29 percent to end at HK$5.20 on Thursday.</p>
<p>Asia Securities had said earlier it was in talks with third parties including the Ministry of Foreign Trade and Economic Cooperation (MOFTEC) of China in relation to a possible capital injection into the company.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
